# Viewport split (640px)

Repo breakpoint: **≤640px mobile**, **≥641px desktop**.

When the user asks to change layout, type size, spacing, or images, **ask 手機 or 桌機 first** unless they already said which. Then edit only that media block (CSS variables `--pjt-*`, `--glass`, etc.).

Do not put desktop and mobile knobs in the same unscoped rule. Shared layout stays outside `@media`. Background photos use `<picture>` so only one JPEG downloads.